[
  {
    "key": "evt_CHS_MIK_03S_0001",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "Shall we get started then?"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CHS_MIK_03S_0002",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "We'll now explain the combination technique."
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CHS_MIK_03S_0003",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "We'll start with the fork."
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CHS_MIK_03S_0004",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "A fork is a technique where you attack\nmultiple pieces with one piece…"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CHS_MIK_03S_0005",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "…at the same time."
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CHS_MIK_03S_0006",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "On the bottom screen, the king and the queen\nare both being attacked by…"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CHS_MIK_03S_0007",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "…a single knight."
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CHS_MIK_03S_0008",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "Since in chess you can only move one piece\nper turn…"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CHS_MIK_03S_0009",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "…the knight will definitely be able to take one\nof the pieces."
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CHS_MIK_03S_0010",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "You can perform a fork with any piece, but\nit's most often done with…"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CHS_MIK_03S_0011",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "…knights, pawns, and the queen."
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CHS_MIK_03S_0012",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "Let's put it into practice."
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CHS_MIK_03S_0013",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "Take the rook by using a fork."
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CHS_MIK_03S_0014",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "That's correct, Kyon."
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CHS_MIK_03S_0015",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "That's a shame, it looks like you messed up.\nTry having another go."
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CHS_MIK_03S_0016",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "It looks like you didn't manage to gain\nadvantage."
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CHS_MIK_03S_0017",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "Make sure to consider the value of each of\nthe pieces, okay?"
  }
]